      "scope": "The four-state local evaluation formula, with formation f and predecessor satisfaction p jointly gating formation, e gating evaluation, and c giving the evaluated condition. An injective encoding into four distinct integers is linked to the native state datatype by the published transfer theorems. Six unsatisfiable negations and two satisfiable wrong-formula controls are checked. This does not replace the native finite-DAG recursion theorem."
